{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">LEAVE statement</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309950","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/LEAVE-statement.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/LEAVE-statement.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"LEAVE-statement\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">LEAVE statement</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"LEAVE-statement__section_N10024_N10021_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Exits from a block. Execution continues with\nthe first statement after the end of the block.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"LEAVE-statement__syntax_GC18TK2695909\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d186572e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"LEAVE-statement__idGDM2KU2672220\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>LEAVE <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> <var class=\"keyword varname\">label</var> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong></code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">label</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">The name of the block you want to leave. If you do not name\na block, the AVM leaves the innermost iterating block that contains\nthe LEAVE statement. If there is no such block, then the AVM leaves\nthe procedure block.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"LEAVE-statement__example_GC18TL2695916\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d186572e145\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">This\nprocedure represents part of a menu program. If the user chooses\nN, P, F, or Q, the procedure leaves the inner choose block and goes\non to process the menu selection. If the user presses any other\nkey, the procedure rings the terminal bell.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-leave.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"LEAVE-statement__idGDM2KW2672227\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DEFINE VARIABLE valid-choice AS CHARACTER NO-UNDO INITIAL &quot;NPFQ&quot;.\nDEFINE VARIABLE selection    AS CHARACTER NO-UNDO FORMAT &quot;x&quot;.\n\nmain-loop:\nREPEAT:\n  choose:\n  REPEAT ON ENDKEY UNDO choose, RETURN:\n    MESSAGE &quot;(N)ext (P)rev (F)ind (Q)uit&quot;\n      UPDATE selection AUTO-RETURN.\n    /* Selection was valid */\n    IF INDEX(valid-choice, selection) &lt;&gt; 0 THEN <strong class=\"ph b\">LEAVE choose.</strong> \n    BELL.\n  END.  /* choose */\n\n  /* Processing for menu choices N, P, F here */\n  IF selection = &quot;Q&quot; THEN <strong class=\"ph b\">LEAVE main-loop.</strong>\nEND. /* REPEAT */</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"LEAVE-statement__see-also_GC18TM2695923\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d186572e186\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"NEXT-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/NEXT-statement.html\">NEXT statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"RETURN-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/RETURN-statement.html\">RETURN statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"UNDO-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/UNDO-statement.html\">UNDO statement</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LE-or-lt-operator.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LE-or-lt-operator.html\">LE or &lt; = operator</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LEFT-TRIM-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LEFT-TRIM-function.html\">LEFT-TRIM function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309950","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"LEAVE statement","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LEAVE-statement.html","type":"Manual"}